WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,390
Okay, here you go

2
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:02,870
There is no guide inside

3
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:05,270
They are all extremely ordinary things.

4
00:00:05,270 --> 00:00:10,260
Secretary General, what are you looking for? No?

5
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:13,460
Just check to see if your bag has a compartment.

6
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:15,020
The job I just gave you

7
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,140
You have to finish it today

8
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:27,830
It's not enough and there's something wrong with your thinking

9
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:35,420
Young people are energetic

10
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:37,700
Especially rich young people

11
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,930
New Assistant Secretary-General

12
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:41,740
yes boss

13
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:43,420
The boss is so arrogant

14
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:44,500
Yes Boss

15
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:47,540
I didn’t tell you what my name was.

16
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,540
My name is Yan Gu

17
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:49,660
It's okay to be cool

18
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:50,900
But write slower

19
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,100
Time moves so fast

20
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,820
I can't tell which words it is.

21
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:55,620
See me writing in the air with flames

22
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:57,020
Do you feel the power?

23
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:59,940
Okay Boss, I remember it.

24
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:00,980
Not timid

25
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:03,140
But humans who are too timid are the least interesting.

26
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:04,760
Not playable

27
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:06,120
Are you going to the second floor?

28
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:09,740
Doesn’t Boss make special elevators?

29
00:01:09,740 --> 00:01:10,860
I'll go to the second floor too

30
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:13,380
Is Boss also eating in the cafeteria on the second floor?
